              "node_type": "text",
              "value": "Creatures marked with an asterisk (*) are summoned with the celestial template if you are good, and the fiendish template if you are evil. If you are neutral, you may choose which template to apply to the creature. Furthermore, when you summon spiders using summon monster or summon nature’s ally, the DC of the summoned monster’s poison and web effects increases by 2."
